{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young female vlogger embarks on a mission to hunt for ghosts. Her search turns out to be fruitful as she manages to encounter the paranormal. However, she now finds herself in a precarious situation, restrained and in need of figuring out how to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique gameplay with a bound character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the challenge of controlling a heroine with her hands and feet tied together. Moving around will be demanding and realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 levels with varied conditions and difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various trials such as having hands bound to feet, being suspended by the legs, or being blindfolded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple hairstyle and outfit options, with the ability to change colors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468820?t=1741148478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468820?t=1741148478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468820/afbd90cc2df9a466118666547ed48aea44f8d24a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741148478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468820/afbd90cc2df9a466118666547ed48aea44f8d24a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741148478","categor